{"id":"cartridges-anatomy","rev":1,"lang":"lt","status":"published","review_flag":null,"disclaimer":null,"title":"Šovinio sandara","summary":"Tūtelė, kapsulė, parakas, kamštelis, šratai ir užsukimas: kas yra stendinio šovinio viduje, kaip kiekviena dalis veikia šūvį ir kokius šovinius draudžia Sporting™ ir Compak® Sporting taisyklės.","body":[{"k":"gear-cartridges-p1","t":"p","html":"<a class=\"term\" href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/cartridge/\"><span lang=\"en\">Cartridge</span> (šovinys)</a> turi viską vienam šūviui: <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/hull/\"><span lang=\"en\">hull</span> (tūtelę)</a> su metaline galvute, <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/primer/\"><span lang=\"en\">primer</span> (kapsulę)</a>, <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/powder/\"><span lang=\"en\">powder</span> (paraką)</a>, <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/wad/\"><span lang=\"en\">wad</span> (kamštelį)</a> ir šratus (shot). Šauliai sako ir „shell“. <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/empties/\"><span lang=\"en\">Empty cases</span> (tuščios tūtelės)</a> – tai iššautos tūtelės.","disc":null,"rule_ref":null,"anchor":"gear-cartridges"},{"k":"dg-cartridge-cutaway","t":"diagram","html":"<figure class=\"dg\" aria-labelledby=\"dg-cartridge-cutaway\"><p class=\"dg-h\" id=\"dg-cartridge-cutaway\">Šovinys išilginiame pjūvyje</p><svg class=\"dg-svg\" viewBox=\"40 70 520 250\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"dg-cartridge-cutaway\" focusable=\"false\"><rect class=\"dg-c1\" x=\"96\" y=\"96\" width=\"440\" height=\"138\" rx=\"3\"/><rect class=\"dg-cut\" x=\"104\" y=\"104\" width=\"424\" height=\"122\"/>\n<path class=\"dg-c2\" d=\"M58 86h20v6h80v146h-80v6h-20z\"/><rect class=\"dg-c3\" x=\"58\" y=\"148\" width=\"26\" height=\"34\" rx=\"2\"/>\n<rect class=\"dg-c4\" x=\"158\" y=\"104\" width=\"54\" height=\"122\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"164\" cy=\"114\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"171.5\" cy=\"122\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"179\" cy=\"114\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"186.5\" cy=\"122\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"194\" cy=\"114\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"201.5\" cy=\"122\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"209\" cy=\"114\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"164\" cy=\"150\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"171.5\" cy=\"142\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"179\" cy=\"150\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"186.5\" cy=\"142\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"194\" cy=\"150\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"201.5\" cy=\"142\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"209\" cy=\"150\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"164\" cy=\"170\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"171.5\" cy=\"178\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"179\" cy=\"170\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"186.5\" cy=\"178\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"194\" cy=\"170\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"201.5\" cy=\"178\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"209\" cy=\"170\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"164\" cy=\"206\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"171.5\" cy=\"198\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"179\" cy=\"206\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"186.5\" cy=\"198\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"194\" cy=\"206\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"201.5\" cy=\"198\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle class=\"dg-gr\" cx=\"209\" cy=\"206\" r=\"1.8\"/>\n<rect class=\"dg-c5\" x=\"212\" y=\"104\" width=\"16\" height=\"122\"/><path class=\"dg-c5l\" d=\"M228 112 l11 106 l11 -106 l11 106 l11 -106M272 106h194M272 224h194M272 106v118\"/>\n<circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"282\" cy=\"116\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"293.8\" cy=\"116\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"305.6\" cy=\"116\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"317.4\" cy=\"116\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"329.2\" cy=\"116\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"341\" cy=\"116\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"352.8\" cy=\"116\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"364.6\" cy=\"116\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"376.4\" cy=\"116\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"388.2\" cy=\"116\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"400\" cy=\"116\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"411.8\" cy=\"116\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"423.6\" cy=\"116\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"435.4\" cy=\"116\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"447.20000000000005\" cy=\"116\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"459\" cy=\"116\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"287\" cy=\"135.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"298.8\" cy=\"135.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"310.6\" cy=\"135.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"322.4\" cy=\"135.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"334.2\" cy=\"135.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"346\" cy=\"135.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"357.8\" cy=\"135.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"369.6\" cy=\"135.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"381.4\" cy=\"135.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"393.2\" cy=\"135.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"405\" cy=\"135.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"416.8\" cy=\"135.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"428.6\" cy=\"135.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"440.4\" cy=\"135.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"452.20000000000005\" cy=\"135.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"464\" cy=\"135.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"282\" cy=\"155\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"293.8\" cy=\"155\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"305.6\" cy=\"155\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"317.4\" cy=\"155\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"329.2\" cy=\"155\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"341\" cy=\"155\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"352.8\" cy=\"155\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"364.6\" cy=\"155\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"376.4\" cy=\"155\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"388.2\" cy=\"155\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"400\" cy=\"155\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"411.8\" cy=\"155\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"423.6\" cy=\"155\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"435.4\" cy=\"155\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"447.20000000000005\" cy=\"155\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"459\" cy=\"155\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"287\" cy=\"174.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"298.8\" cy=\"174.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"310.6\" cy=\"174.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"322.4\" cy=\"174.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"334.2\" cy=\"174.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"346\" cy=\"174.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"357.8\" cy=\"174.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"369.6\" cy=\"174.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"381.4\" cy=\"174.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"393.2\" cy=\"174.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"405\" cy=\"174.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"416.8\" cy=\"174.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"428.6\" cy=\"174.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"440.4\" cy=\"174.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"452.20000000000005\" cy=\"174.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"464\" cy=\"174.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"282\" cy=\"194\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"293.8\" cy=\"194\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"305.6\" cy=\"194\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"317.4\" cy=\"194\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"329.2\" cy=\"194\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"341\" cy=\"194\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"352.8\" cy=\"194\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"364.6\" cy=\"194\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"376.4\" cy=\"194\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"388.2\" cy=\"194\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"400\" cy=\"194\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"411.8\" cy=\"194\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"423.6\" cy=\"194\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"435.4\" cy=\"194\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"447.20000000000005\" cy=\"194\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"459\" cy=\"194\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"287\" cy=\"213.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"298.8\" cy=\"213.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"310.6\" cy=\"213.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"322.4\" cy=\"213.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"334.2\" cy=\"213.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"346\" cy=\"213.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"357.8\" cy=\"213.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"369.6\" cy=\"213.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"381.4\" cy=\"213.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"393.2\" cy=\"213.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"405\" cy=\"213.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"416.8\" cy=\"213.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"428.6\" cy=\"213.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"440.4\" cy=\"213.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"452.20000000000005\" cy=\"213.5\" r=\"5\"/><circle class=\"dg-c6\" cx=\"464\" cy=\"213.5\" r=\"5\"/>\n<path class=\"dg-c7\" d=\"M468 104 L530 165 L468 226 M498 104 L530 165 L498 226 M528 104 L530 165 L528 226\"/>\n<g class=\"dg-dm\"><path d=\"M58 272v18M536 272v18M58 282h478\"/><text x=\"297\" y=\"306\" text-anchor=\"middle\">iššauta tūtelė: paprastai 65–70 mm</text></g><g class=\"dg-n\"><circle cx=\"360\" cy=\"98\" r=\"14\"/><text x=\"360\" y=\"98\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">1</text></g><g class=\"dg-n\"><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"92\" r=\"14\"/><text x=\"70\" y=\"92\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">2</text></g><g class=\"dg-n\"><circle cx=\"71\" cy=\"165\" r=\"14\"/><text x=\"71\" y=\"165\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">3</text></g><g class=\"dg-n\"><circle cx=\"185\" cy=\"120\" r=\"14\"/><text x=\"185\" y=\"120\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">4</text></g><g class=\"dg-n\"><circle cx=\"245\" cy=\"216\" r=\"14\"/><text x=\"245\" y=\"216\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">5</text></g><g class=\"dg-n\"><circle cx=\"400\" cy=\"150\" r=\"14\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">6</text></g><g class=\"dg-n\"><circle cx=\"515\" cy=\"165\" r=\"14\"/><text x=\"515\" y=\"165\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">7</text></g></svg><ol class=\"dg-leg\"><li><b aria-hidden=\"true\">1</b>Tūtelė (plastikinė arba popierinė)</li><li><b aria-hidden=\"true\">2</b>Metalinis dugnas</li><li><b aria-hidden=\"true\">3</b>Kapsulė</li><li><b aria-hidden=\"true\">4</b>Parakas</li><li><b aria-hidden=\"true\">5</b>Kamštelis</li><li><b aria-hidden=\"true\">6</b>Šratai</li><li><b aria-hidden=\"true\">7</b>Tūtelės užsukimas (žvaigždutė iš 6 arba 8 klosčių)</li></ol><figcaption>Kas yra viename šovinyje, nuo metalinio dugno iki užsukimo.</figcaption></figure>","disc":null,"rule_ref":null},{"k":"cartridges-anatomy-p2","t":"p","html":"<a class=\"term\" href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/hull/\"><span lang=\"en\">Hull</span></a> (angl. dar case) – vamzdelis, dažniausiai plastikinis, su metaline galvute apačioje. Būna ir popierinių tūtelių: kai kurios šaudyklos joms teikia pirmenybę, nes jos mažiau šiukšlina gamtą. Iššauta tūtelė dažniausiai 65–70 mm ilgio, ir ji turi tikti jūsų šautuvo <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/chamber/\"><span lang=\"en\">chamber</span> (šovinio lizdui)</a> – žr. <a href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/learn/gun-gauge-and-barrels/\">Kalibras ir vamzdžio ilgis</a>.","disc":null,"rule_ref":null},{"k":"cartridges-anatomy-p3","t":"p","html":"Galvutės centre yra kapsulė. Kai smūgiklis trenkia į ją, kapsulė duoda kibirkštį ir uždega paraką. Parakas ne sprogsta, o labai greitai dega, ir dujos stumia šratų užtaisą vamzdžiu į priekį.","disc":null,"rule_ref":null},{"k":"cartridges-anatomy-p4","t":"p","html":"Tarp parako ir šratų yra kamštelis. Jis veikia kaip kamštis: neleidžia karštoms dujoms praeiti pro šratus, sušvelnina smūgį ir laiko šratus kartu, kol jie keliauja vamzdžiu. Plastikinis kamštelis dažniausiai turi „taurelę“, kuri saugo šratus ir dažnai duoda truputį tankesnį spiečių.","disc":null,"rule_ref":null},{"k":"cartridges-anatomy-p8","t":"p","html":"<a class=\"term\" href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/fibre-wad/\"><span lang=\"en\">Fibre wad</span> (fibros ar veltinio kamštelis)</a> gamtoje suyra, tad daug šaudyklų jo ir reikalauja. Yra ir biologiškai skaidžių plastikinių kamštelių, bet ne visos šaudyklos juos priima.","disc":null,"rule_ref":null},{"k":"cartridges-anatomy-p5","t":"p","html":"Virš kamštelio – šratai: keli šimtai mažų kulkelių. Viršuje tūtelę uždaro <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/crimp/\"><span lang=\"en\">crimp</span> (užsukimas)</a>, dažniausiai „žvaigždutė“ su 6 ar 8 klostėmis. Geras užsukimas tvirtai laiko visa vietoje ir padeda kiekvienam šoviniui šauti taip, kaip ir ankstesniam.","disc":null,"rule_ref":null},{"k":"cartridges-anatomy-p6","t":"p","html":"FITASC Parcours de Chasse – Sporting™ ir Compak® Sporting taisyklės draudžia <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/reloaded-cartridge/\"><span lang=\"en\">reloaded cartridges</span> (pakartotinai užtaisytus šovinius)</a>, tai yra iššautas tūteles, pakartotinai užtaisytas, pavyzdžiui, namuose. Draudžiami ir sklaidikliai (įdėklai, kurie sąmoningai plačiau paskleidžia šratus) ir bet kokie kiti specialūs prietaisai šovinio viduje. Taip pat neleidžiama maišyti skirtingo dydžio ar kokybės šratų, juodąjį paraką ir trasuojamuosius šovinius (šovinius, kurie palieka švytintį pėdsaką). Tad varžyboms vežkitės gamyklinius, taisykles atitinkančius šovinius.","disc":"both","rule_ref":null},{"k":"cartridges-anatomy-p7","t":"tip","html":"Ant dėžutės paprastai nurodomas <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/gauge/\"><span lang=\"en\">gauge</span> (kalibras)</a>, tūtelės ilgis, užtaisas, <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/shot-size/\"><span lang=\"en\">shot size</span> (šratų numeris)</a> ar skersmuo, šratų medžiaga ir kamštelio tipas, o dažnai ir greitis. Mokykitės skaityti dėžutę – ir žinosite, kuo užtaisote.","disc":null,"rule_ref":null},{"k":"gear-cartridges-p5","t":"p","html":"Kai kurios šaudyklos treniruotėms nustato savas aplinkosaugos taisykles, pavyzdžiui, tik fibrinius kamštelius arba tik <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/steel-shot/\"><span lang=\"en\">steel shot</span> (plieninį šratą)</a>: prieš kelionę patikrinkite šaudyklos taisykles. Tuščios tūtelės metamos į šaudymo vietoje esantį kibirą, o šauliai su <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/semi-automatic/\"><span lang=\"en\">semi-automatic</span> (pusiau automatiniais)</a> šautuvais, paliekant vietą, surenka savo išmestas tūteles.","disc":"both","rule_ref":null},{"k":"cartridges-anatomy-p9","t":"p","html":"Trys skaičiai ant dėžutės turi savas pamokas: kalibras (<a href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/learn/gun-gauge-and-barrels/\">Kalibras ir vamzdžio ilgis</a>), šratų numeris (<a href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/learn/cartridges-shot-size/\">Šratų numeris</a>) ir užtaisas (<a href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/learn/cartridges-load-weight/\">Šratų užtaisas</a>).","disc":null,"rule_ref":null}],"notes":[],"phrases":[{"k":"gear-cartridges-ph3","speaker":"coach","en":"Empties in the bin, please, not on the grass.","meaning":"Iššautas tūteles meskite į dėžę.","say":"Tuščias tūteles prašom į dėžę, ne ant žolės.","audio":1},{"k":"gear-cartridges-ph4","speaker":"coach","en":"Steel only on this ground.","meaning":"Šioje šaudykloje lead shot (švininiai šratai) neleidžiami (vietinė, ne FITASC taisyklė).","say":"Šioje šaudykloje — tik plieniniai šratai.","audio":1}],"key_points":[{"k":"gear-cartridges-kp1","html":"Šovinys = tūtelė, kapsulė, parakas, kamštelis, šratai.","checklist":false},{"k":"cartridges-anatomy-kp2","html":"Plastikinis kamštelis dažnai duoda trupučiuką tankesnį spiečių; fibrinis suyra gamtoje.","checklist":false},{"k":"cartridges-anatomy-kp4","html":"FITASC draudžia perkrovimus, sklaidiklius, maišytus šratus, juodąjį paraką ir trasuojamuosius šovinius.","checklist":false},{"k":"cartridges-anatomy-kp5","html":"Skaitykite dėžutę: kalibras, ilgis, užtaisas, šratai, kamštelis.","checklist":false},{"k":"gear-cartridges-kp5","html":"Tuščios tūtelės — į dėžę; pusautomačių savininkai surenka savo tūteles.","checklist":false}],"did_you_know":{"k":"cartridges-anatomy-dyk","html":"Po šūvio plastikinis kamštelis skrenda dar kelias dešimtis metrų už šaudymo vietos. Todėl laukuose aplink senas šaudyklas gali būti pilna kamštelių, tuo tarpu fibra pamažu suyra."},"quiz":[{"k":"cartridges-anatomy-q1","q":"Kas uždega paraką šovinyje?","options":[{"k":"a","text":"Kamštelis"},{"k":"b","text":"Kapsulė"},{"k":"c","text":"Užsukimas"},{"k":"d","text":"Šratai"}],"correct":"b","explain":"Smūgiklis trenkia į kapsulę, ir ta uždega paraką."},{"k":"cartridges-anatomy-q2","q":"Kodėl daug šaudyklų reikalauja fibrinio kamštelio?","options":[{"k":"a","text":"Jie pigesni"},{"k":"b","text":"Jie duoda tankesnį spiečių"},{"k":"c","text":"Jie suyra gamtoje"},{"k":"d","text":"Taip reikalauja FITASC"}],"correct":"c","explain":"Fibra ir veltinis suyra, o paprasti plastikiniai kamšteliai laukuose lieka metų metais."},{"k":"cartridges-anatomy-q3","q":"Kokius šovinius draudžia FITASC taisyklės?","options":[{"k":"a","text":"Gamyklinius su plastikiniu kamšteliu"},{"k":"b","text":"Gamyklinius su fibriniu kamšteliu"},{"k":"c","text":"Šovinius su popierine tūtele"},{"k":"d","text":"Perkrautus šovinius"}],"correct":"d","explain":"Perkrauti šoviniai, sklaidikliai, maišyti šratai, juodasis parakas ir trasuojamieji šoviniai draudžiami.","rule_ref":"sporting:ch7-cartridges","disc":"both"}],"terms":[{"id":"cartridge","en":"Cartridge","local":"šovinys","label":"Cartridge (šovinys)","url":"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/cartridge/"},{"id":"hull","en":"Hull","local":"tūtelė","label":"Hull (tūtelė)","url":"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/hull/"},{"id":"primer","en":"Primer","local":"kapsulė","label":"Primer (kapsulė)","url":"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/primer/"},{"id":"powder","en":"Powder","local":"parakas","label":"Powder (parakas)","url":"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/powder/"},{"id":"wad","en":"Wad","local":"kamštelis","label":"Wad (kamštelis)","url":"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/wad/"},{"id":"fibre-wad","en":"Fibre wad","local":"veltinio kamštelis","label":"Fibre wad (veltinio kamštelis)","url":"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/fibre-wad/"},{"id":"crimp","en":"Crimp","local":"tūtelės užsukimas","label":"Crimp (tūtelės užsukimas)","url":"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/crimp/"},{"id":"chamber","en":"Chamber","local":"šovinio lizdas","label":"Chamber (šovinio lizdas)","url":"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/chamber/"},{"id":"empties","en":"Empty cases","local":"tuščios tūtelės","label":"Empty cases (tuščios tūtelės)","url":"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/empties/"},{"id":"semi-automatic","en":"Semi-automatic","local":"pusiau automatinis šautuvas","label":"Semi-automatic (pusiau automatinis šautuvas)","url":"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/semi-automatic/"},{"id":"steel-shot","en":"Steel shot","local":"plieniniai šratai","label":"Steel shot (plieniniai šratai)","url":"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/steel-shot/"},{"id":"shot-size","en":"Shot size","local":"šratų numeris","label":"Shot size (šratų numeris)","url":"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/shot-size/"},{"id":"load-weight","en":"Load weight","local":"šratų užtaisas","label":"Load weight (šratų užtaisas)","url":"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/load-weight/"},{"id":"gauge","en":"Gauge","local":"kalibras","label":"Gauge (kalibras)","url":"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/gauge/"}],"rule_refs":[{"book":"sporting","id":"ch7-cartridges","label":"Skyrius 7","url":"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/rules/en/sporting/weapons-and-ammunition/?lang=lt#ch7-cartridges"},{"book":"compak","id":"ch18-cartridge-bans","label":"Skyrius 18","url":"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/rules/en/compak/shooting-equipment/?lang=lt#ch18-cartridge-bans"},{"book":"sporting","id":"ch8-turning-empties","label":"Skyrius 8","url":"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/rules/en/sporting/rules-of-conduct-safety/?lang=lt#ch8-turning-empties"},{"book":"compak","id":"ch18-empty-cases","label":"Skyrius 18","url":"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/rules/en/compak/shooting-equipment/?lang=lt#ch18-empty-cases"}],"sources":[{"title":"FITASC — official rules of Parcours de Chasse – Sporting™ and Compak® Sporting","url":"https://www.fitasc.com/disciplines-sportives/reglements-sportifs","fitasc":true},{"title":"C.I.P. — tables of dimensions of cartridges and chambers (TDCC), including shot cartridges","url":"https://www.cip-bobp.org/en/tdcc","fitasc":false}],"evidence":[],"more_in_en":0}
